<urn:ig:d:reach> a cmd:Dimension ; cmd:name "experimental-reach" ; cmd:order 1 ; skos:definition "Whether the apparatus only recognizes recurring patterns or can manufacture controlled states that falsify hypotheses." ; cmd:hasOption <urn:ig:o:reach:0>, <urn:ig:o:reach:1> .
